        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCOCHAIN GROUP: Cⁿ(X; R) = Hom(Cₙ(X), R)\n  = { functions f: {singular n-simplices} → R }"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#007",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
