        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "For R = Z: integer-valued functions on chains.\n  For R = R: real-valued functions (relevant for de Rham)."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#008",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "COBOUNDARY OPERATOR δⁿ: Cⁿ → Cⁿ⁺¹:\n  (δf)(σ) = f(∂σ)  for f ∈ Cⁿ, σ a singular (n+1)-simplex.\n  δδ = 0 follows from ∂∂ = 0."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#009",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
