      "text": "For cochains:\n  (f ⌣ g)(σ) = f(σ|[v₀,...,vₚ]) · g(σ|[vₚ,...,vₚ₊q])\n  for σ: Δᵖ⁺q → X a singular simplex, with the front-p and back-q face maps."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#021",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WELL-DEFINED: The cup product of cocycles is a cocycle; coboundary times anything\n  is a coboundary. So ⌣ descends to cohomology."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#022",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "GRADED RING STRUCTURE:\n  H*(X;R) = ⊕ₙ Hⁿ(X;R) with the cup product is a GRADED-COMMUTATIVE ring:\n  α ⌣ β = (-1)^{pq} β ⌣ α  for α ∈ Hᵖ, β ∈ Hq.\n  [NOT simply commutative — the sign is essential for complex coefficients.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#023",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The graded unit: 1 ∈ H⁰(X;R) (the constant cochain with value 1)."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#024",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHY THIS IS POWERFUL:\n  Two spaces can have identical cohomology groups but different cup products.\n  The cohomology RING distinguishes them.\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#025",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "### Computed Examples"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#026",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nEXAMPLE 1: H*(S¹; Z)\n  H⁰(S¹) = Z (generated by 1)\n  H¹(S¹) = Z (generator α, representing the \"winding 1-cocycle\")\n  All higher = 0.\n  Cup product: α ⌣ α ∈ H² = 0. So H*(S¹) = Z[α]/(α²) (as a ring).\n  (Since H² = 0, α² = 0.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#027",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLE 2: H*(S²; Z)\n  H⁰=Z (gen 1), H²=Z (gen β), rest 0.\n  β ⌣ β ∈ H⁴ = 0. Ring: Z[β]/(β²)."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#028",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLE 3: H*(T²; Z) — the key example\n  H⁰=Z (gen 1), H¹=Z² (gens α,β), H²=Z (gen γ).\n  Cup products:\n    α ⌣ β = γ (the fundamental class)\n    β ⌣ α = -γ  (graded commutativity: (-1)^{1·1} = -1)\n    α ⌣ α = 0, β ⌣ β = 0.\n  Ring: H*(T²) = Z[α,β]/(α²,β²,αβ+βα)."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#029",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLE 4: H*(S¹ × S¹) via Künneth\n  Künneth for cohomology rings (when torsion-free):\n  H*(X×Y;R) ≅ H*(X;R) ⊗ H*(Y;R)  as graded rings.\n  H*(S¹×S¹) = Z[α]/(α²) ⊗ Z[β]/(β²) = Z[α,β]/(α²,β²).\n  This matches the direct computation above. ✓"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#030",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLE 5: S² vs T² — groups same? No, but example of ring distinguishing spaces.\n  RP²×RP²  vs  a different space with same groups but different ring.\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#031",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "### Distinguished Spaces via Cohomology Ring"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#032",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCP² vs S² ∨ S⁴  (complex projective plane vs wedge of spheres):"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#033",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "H*(CP²; Z):  H⁰=Z, H²=Z, H⁴=Z, rest 0.  Generator α of H².\n                α ⌣ α = generator of H⁴.  So α² ≠ 0.\n                RING: Z[α]/(α³)."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#034",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "H*(S² ∨ S⁴; Z):  H⁰=Z, H²=Z, H⁴=Z, rest 0.  Same groups!\n                α ⌣ α = 0 (generator of H² crossed with itself is zero,\n                since the α generator \"comes from\" the S² piece and\n                the H⁴ \"comes from\" the S⁴ piece — no interaction)."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#035",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Groups are the same. Rings are different.\n  CP² ≇ S² ∨ S⁴ is detected by the cup product.\n  (CP² is homeomorphic to no such simple space — it's a true non-trivial manifold.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#036",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "COHOMOLOGY RING AS COMPLETE INVARIANT?\n  Not quite — spaces exist with the same cohomology ring but not homeomorphic.\n  But cohomology ring + extra structure (Steenrod operations, etc.) often classify.\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#037",
      "path": [
        "08-COHOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:topology:08-cohomology, git-history:topology:08-cohomology]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "current_path": "topology/08-COHOMOLOGY.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:cohomology",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[cohomology]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cohomology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COHOMOLOGY.md#038",
      "path": [
