      "text": "0-FORM: a smooth function f: M → R.\n1-FORM: a smooth section of T*M (cotangent bundle).\n  Locally: ω = Σᵢ fᵢ dxᵢ.\n  dxᵢ is the \"differential of the i-th coordinate function.\""
