      "text": "k-FORM: a smooth antisymmetric (0,k) tensor field.\n  Locally: ω = Σ_{i₁<...<iₖ} fᵢ₁...ᵢₖ dxᵢ₁ ∧ ... ∧ dxᵢₖ\n  The wedge product ∧ is antisymmetric: dxᵢ ∧ dxⱼ = -dxⱼ ∧ dxᵢ."
    },
