      "text": "EXTERIOR DERIVATIVE d: Ωᵏ(M) → Ωᵏ⁺¹(M):\n  For a function f: df = Σᵢ (∂f/∂xᵢ) dxᵢ.\n  For a k-form: dω = Σ (df_{...}) ∧ dx_{...}."
